  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Inclusive Communities: increasing access to rights and participation of people with disabilities on personal, community and societal levels, in Kenya and Zimbabwe&#x2019; project, implemented with Regional Psychosocial Support Initiative (REPSSI) and Basic Needs Basic Rights Kenya, aims for people with disabilities to be resilient, accessing their rights and actively and equally participating in national, community and family life in the target areas of Kenya and Zimbabwe.</narrative>
